db/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186497137 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497306 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d6ba6fef-e5a6-577a-86ab-a507607e574c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497416 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186497306 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497416 #edb/ref 1069 "q-131232" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497416 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497416 #edb/ref 1071 "Find the curvature at an arbitrary point on the curve $r(t)$ given that its derivative ${r}^{′}(t)$ and the derivative of the corresponding unit tangent ${T}^{′}(t)$ are as follows: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}^{′}(t)=⟨{t}^{2},\\,2\\sqrt{2}t,\\,4⟩,\\,{T}^{′}(t)=\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}⟨4t,\\,\\sqrt{2}(4-{t}^{2}),\\,-4t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497416 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "f8afba66-d1aa-558e-99f9-1c7592f06bb8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497416 #edb/ref 1074 "Since we are given both the derivative of the curve ${r}^{′}(t)$ and the derivative of the unit tangent ${T}^{′}(t)$, we will use the following formula for the curvature:\n\n$$\nκ(t)=\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}\n$$\n\nNow, we find the magnitudes of ${r}^{′}(t)$ and ${T}^{′}(t):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{T}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{{(4t)}^{2}+{(\\sqrt{2}(4-{t}^{2}))}^{2}+(-4t)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{16{t}^{2}+2{(4-{t}^{2})}^{2}+16{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{16{t}^{2}+(32-16{t}^{2}+2{t}^{4})+16{t}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2{t}^{4}+16{t}^{2}+32} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2({t}^{2}+4)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}({t}^{2}+4) \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{{t}^{2}+4} \\\\ ‖{r}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\sqrt{{({t}^{2})}^{2}+{(2\\sqrt{2}t)}^{2}+{4}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{t}^{4}+8{t}^{2}+16} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}} \\\\  & ={t}^{2}+4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the curvature is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}{‖{r}^{′}(t)‖}=\\frac{(\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{{t}^{2}+4})}{{t}^{2}+4}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{({t}^{2}+4)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497429 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186497462 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497429 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "295eca98-5a56-59b6-be3f-1a7e5fc824dc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497429 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186335734 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497447 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186497455 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497447 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7996da4d-65c7-519a-8f8a-fbfe32a74aa7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497447 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186497416 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497455 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8c342d34-2861-5edd-8ee3-b1b129ac8611" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497455 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186266122 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497462 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186497471 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497462 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a52d7a0f-ae82-55ee-b781-f303b31787d0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497462 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186348404 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497471 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186497447 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497471 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "bc2db5d0-2c5f-5532-ae92-9e8a5ca14fe2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186497471 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186433629 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
